      "id": "qa_1743519364212_tqw79zrw",
      "question": "where is opd in kgmu",
      "answer": "OPD (Outpatient Department) services are available in KGMU. The main OPD building is a 3-storied building. Additionally, some departments have their own OPD locations:\n\n*   **Cardiology, Obstetrics & Gynecology, Urology, Psychiatry, Tuberculosis & Chest Diseases, Orthopedics, and Rheumatology:** These departments have OPDs in their respective buildings.\n*   **Medicine, Neurology, Pediatrics, and Ophthalmology:** These OPDs are located in the 3-storied OPD building.\n*   **Surgical specialties, skin, and ENT:** These OPDs are located in the old building in front of the OPD Ticket Counter.\n\nFor specific directions, it's best to ask at the main gate or any information desk upon arrival.\n",
